 "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang has appeared on The Ezra Klein Show to discuss AI development, amid a wider discussion around its responsible usage and safety. Klein", "published_at": "2026-09-25T16:31:14Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-26T11:11:59Z", "body": "bodies/feed-856e20d6ca4e.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15d80e892a00", "title": "AI and the Productivity Trap: A Finance Perspective", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/in-depth/d01262/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/in-depth/3074461/3074461.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "投资", "科技"], "excerpt": "What is the point of AI if employees are expected to do more work, at greater intensity, in the same hours? The Daiichi Life Research Institute’s Kashiwamura", "published_at": "2026-09-23T21:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-24T12:12:06Z", "body": "bodies/feed-15d80e892a00.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-15ee8d30b087", "title": "拆解下阿里的 AI 经济学，与它的下注", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370865", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/f2/4a/f24ad16054b704027f7e33527256925b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "作者｜张鹏\n\n\n编辑｜ 苏子华\n\n9 月 22 日，杭州云栖大会。阿里巴巴集团 CEO 吴泳铭和往年一样，做了开场的主旨演讲。\n\n\n过去几年云栖大会的主旨演讲，可以当作「技术风向标」来听，会抛出很多重磅的技术判断，比如，「大模型是下一代操作系统」、「超级 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-23T06:02:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-23T11:11:57Z", "body": "